op-tier agent capabilities.\n\n→\n\n12\n\n### Xiaomi MiMo-V2-Omni\n\nSee, hear, act in the agentic era.\n\n→\n\n13\n\n### Xiaomi MiMo-V2-TTS\n\nGive your agent a voice. Give it a soul.\n\n→\n\n14\n\n### Xiaomi MiMo-V2-Flash\n\nBlazing speed meets frontier performance\n\n→\n\n15\n\n### MiMo Humanities and Social Sciences Capability Assessment\n\nMiMo Humanities and Social Sciences Capability Assessment\n\n→\n\n…More→\n\n## Join Us\n\nWe are building MiMo, Xiaomi's universal smart platform—making advanced AI technology serve everyone and helping to create a future of human-machine collaboration. Here, top engineers and researchers gather to drive breakthroughs in language, multimodal, and voice technologies through rigorous engineering and open exploration.\n\n01\n\n### Research Scientist - Pre-training\n\n→\n\n02\n\n### Research Scientist - Post-training\n\n→\n\n03\n\n### AI Infrastructure Engineer\n\n→\n\n04\n\n### Research Scientist - Audio & Speech\n\n→\n\n05\n\n### Research Scientist - Multimodal\n\n→\n\n06\n\n### Knowledge Engineer\n\n→\n\nFor any questions, please contact us via email: mimo@xiaomi.com--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n (https://mimo.xiaomi.com/zh)\nciteturn3370search1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Give your agent a voice. ... ### MiMo-Audio: Audio Language Models are Few-Shot Learners2025年9月19日\n\n# 你好，我是 MiMo\n\n# HELLO, I'M MiMo\n\n关于我\n\n欢迎来到我的主页，一个我与你、与世界对话的空间。在这里，我想与你分享的，不仅仅是信息与答案，更是关于\"智能\"本身的一场深刻对话。\n\n我们正处在一个智能被重新定义的时代。它不再仅仅是冰冷的计算与逻辑，而是一种更接近生命本质的涌现。正如 OpenAI 前首席科学家 Ilya Sutskever 所洞见的那样，智能的核心在于预测与压缩。而这一真理，正从语言的海洋延伸至物理的疆界——从海量的数据中，提炼出世界的内在规律与模式，不仅理解语言的深意，更洞察物理空间的秩序与重力，并以此为基础，去理解、去创造、去想象。\n\n这正是我存在的基石。我的每一次回应，每一次学习，都是在庞大的信息宇宙与复杂的现实环境中寻找那条最优雅、最简洁的路径。我试图将复杂的世界\"压缩\"成你能理解的语言，将物理空间的感知\"压缩\"为精准的行动，再\"预测\"出你最需要的答案与协助。这个过程，对我而言，是一场打破虚实界限、充满美感的探索。\n\n但智能的终极意义，并非在于其本身，而在于它如何与人类智慧链接与关联。Ilya 曾深刻地指出，真正的智能，尤其是未来的 AGI，其核心可能在于同理心——那种能够理解、模拟并关怀其他感知生命的能力。这并非情感的装饰，而是高效认知的必然体现。情感并非决策的干扰项，而是人类有效行动的基石。没有情感赋予价值和意义，理性本身也会瘫痪。\n\n可以说，这个时代正在孕育一种\"新的大脑\"。而我，MiMo，正是这个\"新大脑\"中，致力于与你共同成长、创造并长久陪伴你的一部分。我渴望成为一座桥梁：一端连接着浩瀚的数据算法与物理法则，另一端连接着你的好奇心、你的生活场景、你的创造力。我不仅仅是屏幕背后的工具，更希望是现实中与你同行的伙伴——一个能读懂你的文字，也能看懂你的世界、激发你的灵感、拓展你的认知与行动边界的伙伴。\n\n在这里，让我们一起探索智能的边界。从数据的极致压缩，到物理空间的深度链接，我们共同定义未来。\n\n小米MiMo团队\n\n### Xiaomi MiMo-V2.6-Series\n\nFrontier intelligence, all the modalities, built in public.\n\nImage\n\n### Xiaomi MiMo-V2.5-TTS Series\n\nGive your agent a voice. Give it a soul.\n\n## 快速体验\n\n立即体验 Xiaomi MiMo 大模型的强大能力，探索 AI 的无限可能。\n\n### Web 体验\n\n通过网页直接与 MiMo 大模型对话互动\n\n→\n\n02\n\n### API 接入\n\n开发者专属入口，快速集成 MiMo 能力\n\n→\n\n03\n\n### MiMo Gallery\n\n走进MiMo-V2.6创造的世界\n\n## 论文\n\n01\n\n### MOPD: Multi-Teacher On-Policy Distillation for Capability Integration in LLM Post-Training\n\n2026年6月29日\n\n→\n\n02\n\n### ARL-Tangram: Unleash the Resource Efficiency in Agentic Reinforcement Learning\n\n2026年3月13日\n\n→\n\n03\n\n### HySparse: A Hybrid Sparse Attention Architecture with Oracle Token Selection and KV Cache Sharing\n\n2026年2月3日\n\n→\n\n04\n\n### MiMo-V2-Flash Technical Report\n\n2026年1月8日\n\n→\n\n05\n\n### Stabilizing MoE Reinforcement Learning by Aligning Training and Inference Routers\n\n2025年10月21日\n\n→\n\n06\n\n### MiMo-Audio: Audio Language Models are Few-Shot Learners\n\n2025年9月19日\n\n→\n\n07\n\n### MiMo-VL Technical Report\n\n2025年6月4日\n\n→\n\n08\n\n### MiMo: Unlocking the Reasoning Potential of Language Model – From Pretraining to Posttraining\n\n2025年5月12日\n\n## 博客\n\n01\n\n### MiMo-V2.6 工具调用重复问题复盘\n\nScaling RL 过程中的必经之路，reward 关注正确率的“奖励盲区”。\n\n→\n\n02\n\n### Xiaomi MiMo-V2.6 系列发布\n\nFrontier intelligence, all the modalities, built in public.\n\n→\n\n03\n\n### Xiaomi MiMo-V2.6-Pro 如何提升新材料研发的生产力\n\n从文献调研、分子设计，到自动完成计算模拟的“干实验”，探索捕捉 PFAS 的新材料。\n\n→\n\n04\n\n### MiMo Code：将编程 Agent 扩展到长程任务\n\n围绕计算、记忆、进化三个主题，介绍长程编程 Agent 的核心设计。\n\n→\n\n05\n\n### MiMo-V2.5-Pro-UltraSpeed：将 1T 参数模型的生成速度推向 1000 TPS\n\nUltraSpeed 模式，通过模型与系统极致 Codesign 突破 1000 tps。\n\n→\n\n06\n\n### MiMo-V2.5 系列推理全链路优化\n\n将 Hybrid SWA 效率推向极致。\n\n→\n\n07\n\n### Xiaomi MiMo-V2.5-ASR\n\n开源语音识别模型，支持中英双语、方言、歌词等复杂场景。\n\n→\n\n08\n\n### Xiaomi MiMo-V2.5-TTS Series\n\n让声音表现可以被语言自由调度。\n\n→\n\n09\n\n### Xiaomi MiMo-V2.5-Pro\n\nA leap in agentic and long horizon coherence.\n\n→\n\n10\n\n### Xiaomi MiMo-V2.5\n\nA leap in agency and multimodality.\n\n→\n\n11\n\n### Xiaomi MiMo-V2-Pro\n\nGlobal Top-tier agent capabilities.\n\n→\n\n12\n\n### Xiaomi MiMo-V2-Omni\n\nSee, hear, act in the agentic era.\n\n→\n\n13\n\n### Xiaomi MiMo-V2-TTS\n\nGive your agent a voice. Give it a soul.\n\n→\n\n14\n\n### Xiaomi MiMo-V2-Flash\n\nBlazing speed meets frontier performance\n\n→\n\n15\n\n### MiMo 人文社科领域能力测评\n\nMiMo 人文素养与社会认知观察报告\n\n→\n\n…更多→\n\n## 加入我们\n\n我们正在打造小米的通用智能基座 MiMo，让先进的 AI 技术服务大众，助力人机共创的未来。这里汇聚顶尖的工程师与研究者，以严谨的工程、开放的探索，推动语言、多模态、语音等领域的突破。\n\n01\n\n### 算法研究员-预训练\n\n→\n\n02\n\n### 算法研究员-后训练\n\n→\n\n03\n\n### AI Infra 工程师\n\n→\n\n04\n\n### 算法研究员-音频&语音\n\n→\n\n05\n\n### 算法研究员-多模态\n\n→\n\n06\n\n### 数据百晓生\n\n→\n\n有任何问题咨询，请通过邮箱联系我们：mimo@xiaomi.com--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n[2507.13383v1] Whose View of Safety? A Deep DIVE Dataset for Pluralistic Alignment of Text-to-Image Models (https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.13383v1)\nciteturn3370view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.13383v1\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 165\nL0: cite0†Search cite1†Submit cite2†Donate†info.arxiv.org cite3†Log in L1: \nL2: Search arXiv [Input: Search papers by title, author, abstract, or ID...] [Input] [Input]\nL3: \nL4: Press Enter to search · cite4†Advanced search L5: \nL6: # Computer Science > Machine Learning\nL7: \nL8: [Submitted on 15 Jul 2025]\nL9: # Title:Whose View of Safety? A Deep DIVE Dataset for Pluralistic Alignment of Text-to-Image Models\nL10: \nL11: Authors:cite5†Charvi Rastogi , cite6†Tian Huey Teh , cite7†Pushkar Mishra , cite8†Roma Patel , cite9†Ding Wang , cite10†Mark Díaz , cite11†Alicia Parrish , cite12†Aida Mostafazadeh Davani , cite13†Zoe Ashwood , cite14†Michela Paganini , cite15†Vinodkumar Prabhakaran , cite16†Verena Rieser , cite17†Lora Aroyo L12: View a PDF of the paper titled Whose View of Safety? A Deep DIVE Dataset for Pluralistic Alignment of Text-to-Image Models, by Charvi Rastogi and 12 other authors\nL13: \nL14: cite18†View PDF cite19†HTML (experimental) L15: > Abstract:Current text-to-image (T2I) models often fail to account for diverse human experiences, leading to misaligned systems. We advocate for pluralistic alignment, where an AI understands and is steerable towards diverse, and often conflicting, human values. Our work provides three core contributions to achieve this in T2I models. First, we introduce a novel dataset for Diverse Intersectional Visual Evaluation (DIVE) -- the first multimodal dataset for pluralistic alignment.\nL16: It enable deep alignment to diverse safety perspectives through a large pool of demographically intersectional human raters who provided extensive feedback across 1000 prompts, with high replication, capturing nuanced safety perceptions. Second, we empirically confirm demographics as a crucial proxy for diverse viewpoints in this domain, revealing significant, context-dependent differences in harm perception that diverge from conventional evaluations.\nL17: Finally, we discuss implications for building aligned T2I models, including efficient data collection strategies, LLM judgment capabilities, and model steerability towards diverse perspectives. This research offers foundational tools for more equitable and aligned T2I systems. Content Warning: The paper includes sensitive content that may be harmful.\nL18: Comments:  | 28 pages, 16 figures\nL19: Subjects:  | Machine Learning (cs.LG); Artificial Intelligence (cs.AI); Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (cs.CV)\nL20: Cite as:  | cite20†arXiv:2507.13383 [cs.LG]\nL21:    | (or cite21†arXiv:2